  (text "2 Lighting path: ideal diodes, eFuse, INA228" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 3.81 3.81) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6beda58d-67eb-505e-afed-985779a06d1b"))
  (text "Two LM74700 ideal diodes OR the dock and the internal pack onto LIGHT_BUS. The dock's is always on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9283b67d-20b9-5fa5-aefc-9bd9a5776855"))
  (text "LIGHT_BUS has only small ceramics, so plugging a live dock into a switched-off shark charges ~30 uF through the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4976b731-f8e8-594f-a2d3-f36d58d4114f"))
  (text "LEMO, not the bulk caps: C32/C33 sit behind the eFuse (EFUSE_OUT), which ramps them up (dVdt), and hold up the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "038f27ed-174f-524d-b3e8-a6abb334fbb8"))
  (text "converter's input while the ideal diodes switch between dock and pack." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fc2ae587-3508-5d1c-b5ef-367ca10cfd31"))
  (text "The pack's can be switched off (PACK_OFF) while the dock runs the lights; its FET's body diode still holds the bus" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e9ded90c-c3d9-5580-80d3-dc47ae22e08a"))
  (text "if the dock is pulled, until the base turns it back on. Defaults to on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 64.77 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25b10d19-8c06-5ddf-a44d-cb4af8736944"))
  (text "Pack: off-the-shelf 4S BMS on the cells, the main power switch in its lead, XT30 to J3; F1 protects lights and charging." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "04a3475d-42cb-5757-8b48-747e07f491d0"))
  (text "eFuse TPS259827ONRGE: no overvoltage lockout (the pack and dock reach 16.8 V), circuit breaker." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2102ad17-7414-5cf1-a8e4-2c8923eb5f7d"))
  (text "ILIM 130R = about 11.3 A (datasheet: 300R = 5 A, 182R = 8.1 A, 100R = 14.7 A). UVLO 86.6k/10k: on at 11.6 V, off at 10.6 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d274dbb6-6f5c-55fe-ad90-8945d22259a6"))
  (text "LIGHT_OFF from the expander turns the lights off; defaults to on, so the lights work without the base." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "45bfa616-94ae-598a-8e68-1640875adff2"))
  (text "ITIMER, RETRY_DLY and dVdt values are starting points: check against the datasheet for the converter's input capacitance." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c051ed7a-d041-502c-a1af-bb2cccfb0aec"))
  (text "INA228 on the output: 2 mOhm shunt, address 0x40 (A0 = A1 = GND); its ALERT shares PWR_INT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "52115529-3ff1-51fb-866a-c03232a414ad"))
  (wire (pts (xy 701.04 167.64) (xy 701.04 170.18)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "b23159b1-b4a1-59fa-b96b-76ce11cf1aa6"))
